# Requiem of Sin (otherAreas 83), the battlefield won the way a player wins it. Despachiaire's 578 (the letter Y,
# Prog 1), then battlefield 678 entered. The three Shikarees killed: their group's allDeath (handleAllMonstersDefeated)
# shows the Armoury Crate and sets no status. The crate's trigger: the loot, WON, cutsceneTimer 5. Each battlefield
# tick (CBattlefield::onTick, once its 1 s has passed) reads the timer and counts it down; the sixth reads 0 and
# cleans up, whose onBattlefieldLeave (won) opens 32001. A 2 s tick runs one battlefield tick each (the 1 s is strict,
# so 1 s ticks run one every other tick). Finished: completed (battlefieldWin 678).
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/578 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TangoWithATracker completed
login
trigger Despachiaire                    # available, the wait 0, Prog 0: 578
finish                                  # the letter Y; the wait 1800198000; Prog 1
warp -617.9,-1.5,505.7 BoneyardGully
trigger _081                            # the letter: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=97                  # index 6, area 1: Requiem of Sin (678)
finish                                  # in 678: begun; the letter spent
kill SHIKAREE_Z_ROS
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT                 # all three down: the Armoury Crate shows
trigger Armoury_Crate+84                # the loot; WON, cutsceneTimer 5
tick 2000                               # reads 5
tick 2000                               # 4
tick 2000                               # 3
tick 2000                               # 2
tick 2000                               # 1
tick 2000                               # 0: the cleanup; 32001
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 678: completed
